# 孔邊當錨:h0e2 = 孔1第2邊(v=1800,u∈[1800,2200]),材料側=孔外(向下 -v 方向是材料)
# at-face 貼孔邊 → footprint v∈[1800,1827](孔下緣往外展)
# 裁切序（I19）:邊界材圈住 e0/e2,e3 放邊界主支;主支 4 頂邊界材側面,
# 副支 5 起點頂邊界主支側面(u=27)、終點頂主支 4 側面(u=2790)

surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 4000,0 4000,3000 0,3000 hole 1800,1200 2200,1200 2200,1800 1800,1800

grid 1 on 1 u 2800

timber 1 20 20 role boundary
timber 2 20 20 role boundary
timber 3 27 33 role primary
timber 4 20 20 role primary
timber 5 27 33 role secondary

place 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-face e2 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at-face e3 +v +n
place 4 on 1 at-line grid 1 u 0 +v +n
place 5 on 1 at-face h0e2 through 2000 +u +n
